          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Suppose a swimming pool is being built in your school. Two choices are available for the dimensions of the pool: (A) 8 ft (depth) × 50 ft × 20 ft and (B) 6 ft (depth) × 100 ft × 15 ft. Which option would be suitable/appropriate for your school? Why? What parameters/aspects did you consider to make the choice? [1 cubic foot ≈ 28.3 litres]"
